Exercises & Challenges

    Add a new team member with:

        Two SSH keys from different devices

        Sudo access only for specific service restart commands

        Password that expires in 30 days

    Modify SSH configuration to:

        Listen on both IPv4 and IPv6

        Add custom banner from files/ssh_banner.txt

        Enable 2FA with AuthenticationMethods publickey,keyboard-interactive

    Create a custom MOTD script that displays:

        System information

        Last login

        Security patch status

    Implement fail2ban rules to:

        Block IPs after 3 failed SSH attempts

        Send email alerts for repeated failures

    Add SELinux/AppArmor profile management tasks
